Store or resolve secrets under owner-scoped references with an explicit encryption/key strategy; preserve external environment/secret-provider references when useful. Write-only updates, redacted exports/previews/audit/UI/MCP, and credential revocation semantics required. Classify host-execution settings separately. Acceptance: cross-user reference substitution denied; redacted read-modify-write does not erase existing values; rotation, failure and leak-regression tests pass.
